king and sharp movement are the keys to survival.\n\nWith smooth controls, dynamic arenas, and an energetic community, Viper Tags delivers endless replayability. Will you outsmart your friends and prove yourself as the ultimate tagger, or will you get caught slipping?\n\nGet ready to move fast, play hard, and strike like a viper.", "short_description": "Viper Tags is a fast-paced multiplayer VR experience where players tag, dodge, and outmaneuver opponents in dynamic arenas. Use speed, strategy, and precision to become the ultimate Viper in this action-packed virtual playground."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vipertags/private-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "shiny", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vipertaggers/info", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "24910716455216624"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622290_660749343494069_7472410337168269559_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VXk0TkRm-NoQ7kNvwFNjJJ5&_nc_oc=AdrdNkvpCag1qGaLK06cCruSepTOXMgLWOGthoUMavjg2L1XG7CyrcWlZblkUCLICrU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQKJayJBXZxGkC8u0DKgcEi